switchfish is made of parts under different licenses; docs/UPSTREAM.md lists where each came from.

- framework/            LGPL-3.0-or-later and the PopCap Games Framework License 1.1, our changes
                        included (framework/LICENSE, framework/LICENSE-LGPL-3.0.txt,
                        framework/COPYING-GPL-3.0.txt)
- game/                 decompiled game code from WinFish, "as-is"; modifications MIT, like upstream
- third_party/          their own licenses (SDL-Mixer-X: zlib for the parts we build; lz4: BSD 2-clause,
                        third_party/lz4/LICENSE)
- port/romfs/fonts/     Fredoka, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Fredoka-OFL.txt)
- switch/icon.jpg       the NRO icon: the game's guppy redrawn by an image model, a likeness of a
                        character that belongs to the game's owners; not covered by the MIT license below
- everything else, our own work (port/, scripts/, tests/, docker/, docs/, sf.sh, the widescreen
  sides in port/romfs/widescreen/): the MIT license below

